  },
  "body": "Escape dots inside path parts in `compute_module_name`, the same way `module_name_from_path` already does. This maps `pkg/foo.test.py` to module `pkg.foo_test` instead of the invalid `pkg.foo.test`.\n\nThe change is one line — the same `p.replace(., _)` pattern already used by the sibling `module_name_from_path` fallback.\n\ncloses: #14514",
